鹽人應該都會覺得好吃，份量還是偏少；\n年糕唯一的亮點應該是店家自製的醬料，我是吃飯喜歡配小菜的人，不難吃，但也沒有好吃到非拍照紀錄不可。\n\n整體還是中間偏上水準，能感受到煮麵的師傅對料理的基本堅持，推薦路過的人不妨試試。",null,[0,24]]]],[null,1777425767000000,1777425767000000,"4 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfdmZMWHBSdjFobmQyTkdVWTl6Sk80UQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfdmZMWHBSdjFobmQyTkdVWTl6Sk80URoTQ2d3STU3ckZ6d1lRbEtucDNnRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwigtqyB9tmWAxV5UPUHHSP0BiMQ_2MImgEoCg"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8806611178674263246/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVjJOWFRYaFZWR1JtWlc1V2JrNHdVbFpPTWpsWFZERmthVmx0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8806611178674263246/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVjJOWFRYaFZWR1JtWlc1V2JrNHdVbFpPTWpsWFZERmthVmx0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8806611178674263246/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVjJOWFRYaFZWR1JtWlc1V2JrNHdVbFpPTWpsWFZERmthVmx0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8806611178674263246/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVjJOWFRYaFZWR1JtWlc1V2JrNHdVbFpPTWpsWFZERmthVmx0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8806611178674263246/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVjJOWFRYaFZWR1JtWlc1V2JrNHdVbFpPTWpsWFZERmthVmx0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8806611178674263246/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVjJOWFRYaFZWR1JtWlc1V2JrNHdVbFpPTWpsWFZERmthVmx0WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝你今天選擇我們🫶很開心我們聽到了，官方Line:@356iuajo\n請往這與小編分享更多，讓我們一起分享啦～\n",null,[0,57]]]],[null,null,4040,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCV2NXTXhVVGRmZW5Wbk4wUlZOMjlXVDFkaVltYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x3ac5197cb544f9fd!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjBWcWMxUTdfenVnN0RVN29WT1diYmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://ww